11-11T22:20:10Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Text selection is kept when switching between svelte routers(If it is in `$layout.svelte`). I don't know if this shouldn't be cleared by the router by default either?\r\n\r\nThe `router.js` file just executes `document.body.focus();` every time the router is rebooted:\r\nhttps://github.com/sveltejs/kit/blob/39b69677635a59b40675d375c64bbc4507ea0ea5/packages/kit/src/runtime/client/router.js#L245\r\nAnd for the scroll position (conditionally):\r\nhttps://github.com/sveltejs/kit/blob/39b69677635a59b40675d375c64bbc4507ea0ea5/packages/kit/src/runtime/client/router.js#L254\r\nShould text selection be treated the same?\r\n\r\n`document.body.focus();` and `scrollTo(0, 0);` is to simulate a full website refresh.\r\nShould `router.js` be run with a line that resets the text selection:\r\n```javascript\r\nwindow.getSelection().empty();\r\n```\r\n\r\nI emphasize: This is NOT needed directly by me, but I noticed this behavior during experiments with sveltekit.","closed_by":{"login":"Rich-Harris","id":1162160,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjIxNjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1162160?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris","html_url":"https://github.com/Rich-Harris","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/repos","event